    "字号始终跟随系统动态字体与辅助功能设置；三档密度只调整间距与行高，不改变字号、图标或可触控区域（不小于 44pt）。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Fonts always follow the system Dynamic Type and accessibility settings; the three density levels only adjust spacing and line height, never font sizes, icons, or touch targets (minimum 44pt)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "字号始终跟随系统动态字体与辅助功能设置；三档密度只调整间距与行高，不改变字号、图标或可触控区域（不小于 44pt）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
