    "锁屏倒计时由系统调度：本试点开始后约 30 分钟自动结束，单次 Live Activity 最长约 8 小时；App 退到后台后不会持续刷新验证码。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Lock Screen countdown is scheduled by the system. This pilot ends automatically about 30 minutes after it starts, and a single Live Activity lasts at most about 8 hours. The app does not keep refreshing codes in the background."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
