    "iOS 不允许 App 在运行时修改显示名称；备用图标只通过系统的 App 图标 API 切换，名称与默认图标仍由 Xcode 工程配置决定。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS does not let apps change their display name at runtime. Alternate icons switch only through the system app-icon API; the name and default icon still come from the Xcode project configuration."
