    "该网站已被「自动填充域名规则」屏蔽。可在 Monica 设置 → 自动填充中调整。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This site is blocked by your autofill domain rules. Adjust them in Monica Settings → Autofill."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该网站已被「自动填充域名规则」屏蔽。可在 Monica 设置 → 自动填充中调整。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "这些规则只影响 Monica 自己提供的自动填充候选和凭据标识。系统设置里其它密码管理器、以及你在系统面板中手动选择的其它来源都不受影响。规则保存在本机 Keychain，不写入日志，也不进入备份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These rules only affect the autofill candidates and credential identities that Monica itself provides. Other password managers in system settings, and other sources you pick manually in the system panel, are unaffected. Rules are stored in the local Keychain, never in logs, and are not included in backups."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则只影响 Monica 自己提供的自动填充候选和凭据标识。系统设置里其它密码管理器、以及你在系统面板中手动选择的其它来源都不受影响。规则保存在本机 Keychain，不写入日志，也不进入备份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
