    "隐藏文本默认只显示掩码；点右侧的显示按钮才会出现明文，遮挡和明文都不会写入搜索索引或日志。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hidden text is masked by default. Tap the show button to reveal it; neither the mask nor the revealed value is written to the search index or logs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隐藏文本默认只显示掩码；点右侧的显示按钮才会出现明文，遮挡和明文都不会写入搜索索引或日志。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
