    "只记录 SSO 配置用于查阅与打开登录页。Monica 不会代替你完成第三方登录，也不会读取浏览器 cookie 或 OAuth token。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stores SSO configuration for reference and for opening the sign-in page. Monica never signs in to third-party providers for you and never reads browser cookies or OAuth tokens."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只记录 SSO 配置用于查阅与打开登录页。Monica 不会代替你完成第三方登录，也不会读取浏览器 cookie 或 OAuth token。"
          }
