    "打开分享包": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open package"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "打开分享包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "把这条 Send 封装成端到端加密的 .send 分享包。Monica 没有云端中继，分享包和一次性分享码需要分开交给对方。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wrap this Send item in an end-to-end encrypted .send package. Monica has no cloud relay, so the package and the one-time code must reach the recipient separately."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "把这条 Send 封装成端到端加密的 .send 分享包。Monica 没有云端中继，分享包和一次性分享码需要分开交给对方。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "接收方每次成功解密消耗一次，次数用尽或过期后自动失效；失败不会扣次数。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every successful decrypt by the recipient uses one view. The package dies when the views run out or the date passes; failures never count."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "接收方每次成功解密消耗一次，次数用尽或过期后自动失效；失败不会扣次数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "明文只在内存中加密，.send 文件里没有可读内容。分享码不会保存，关闭本页后需要重新生成。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plaintext is encrypted in memory only, so the .send file holds nothing readable. The share code is not saved; reopening this page requires generating it again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "明文只在内存中加密，.send 文件里没有可读内容。分享码不会保存，关闭本页后需要重新生成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
