          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "解锁保险库后才能检查 iCloud 上的变更。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后「云端保险库」会多出 iCloud 选项；云端只保存加密后的保险库文件。未登录 iCloud、无网络或容器未配置时，本机保险库仍可正常使用。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once enabled, “Cloud Vault” also lists iCloud. Only the encrypted vault file is stored; the local vault keeps working when iCloud is signed out, offline, or its container is not configured."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后「云端保险库」会多出 iCloud 选项；云端只保存加密后的保险库文件。未登录 iCloud、无网络或容器未配置时，本机保险库仍可正常使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iCloud 同步已在设置中关闭": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud sync is turned off in Settings"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iCloud 同步已在设置中关闭"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "使用当前 Apple ID 的 iCloud 私人数据库，上传完整的加密保险库文件；云端记录里只有密文与不透明的版本标记。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Upload the complete encrypted vault file to the private database of the current Apple ID; iCloud records hold only ciphertext and opaque revision markers."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使用当前 Apple ID 的 iCloud 私人数据库，上传完整的加密保险库文件；云端记录里只有密文与不透明的版本标记。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在「云端备份」中配置 WebDAV 服务器，或登录 OneDrive；使用 iCloud 时请确认已在设置中开启 iCloud 同步，且 App 已配置 iCloud 容器。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configure a WebDAV server or sign in to OneDrive under “Cloud backup” first; for iCloud, make sure iCloud sync is enabled in Settings and the app has an iCloud container."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在「云端备份」中配置 WebDAV 服务器，或登录 OneDrive；使用 iCloud 时请确认已在设置中开启 iCloud 同步，且 App 已配置 iCloud 容器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请先在系统设置中登录 iCloud，再回到此处重试。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign in to iCloud in the system settings, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请先在系统设置中登录 iCloud，再回到此处重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
