    "只保存 Steam Guard 的离线 shared_secret，用于本地生成验证码；不会读取登录 cookie、identity_secret，也不会发起任何 Steam 网络请求。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stores only the offline Steam Guard shared_secret used to generate codes locally. It never reads login cookies or identity_secret, and never makes Steam network requests."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "只保存 Steam Guard 的离线 shared_secret，用于本地生成验证码；不会读取登录 cookie、identity_secret，也不会发起任何 Steam 网络请求。"
          }
