    },
    "仅在保险库解锁时发布": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅在保险库解锁时发布"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Publish only while the vault is unlocked"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "始终开启": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "始终开启"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Always on"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "身份条目由解密后的条目生成，锁定状态下无法发布。这一项由架构保证，不能关闭。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "身份条目由解密后的条目生成，锁定状态下无法发布。这一项由架构保证，不能关闭。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Identity entries are built from decrypted items, so nothing can be published while the vault is locked. The architecture enforces this and it cannot be turned off."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "仅生物识别解锁后发布身份": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "仅生物识别解锁后发布身份"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Publish identities only after biometric unlock"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，用主密码解锁的会话不会把身份写入系统凭据列表，避免别人知道主密码后立刻拿到自动填充建议。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，用主密码解锁的会话不会把身份写入系统凭据列表，避免别人知道主密码后立刻拿到自动填充建议。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, a session unlocked with the master password does not write identities to the system credential list, so knowing the master password alone does not immediately produce AutoFill suggestions."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "锁定后清空已发布身份": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "锁定后清空已发布身份"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clear published identities after locking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "开启后，锁定或解锁失败时会清空 Monica 已发布到系统的身份条目；下次解锁并载入条目后会自动补发一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开启后，锁定或解锁失败时会清空 Monica 已发布到系统的身份条目；下次解锁并载入条目后会自动补发一次。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When on, locking the vault or a failed unlock clears the Monica identities published to the system; they are published again once the vault is unlocked and items are loaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最近一次未发布": {
